# This repository is for translation collaboration, not for redistributing
# the full Rose & Violet mod or game assets.

# Default: keep heavy/raw mod trees out of Git.
/Characters/
/FEmulator/
/OptionalModFiles/
/P5REssentials/
/tools/

# Runtime/build outputs and third-party binaries.
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.json
*.deps.json
*.runtimeconfig.json
*.png
*.dds
*.GMD
*.GAP
*.AWB
*.ACB
*.CPK
*.PAK
*.BIN
*.BF
*.BMD
*.TBL
*.EVT

# Logs, caches, temporary and backup work.
*.log
Contributors_list.txt
控制台日志.txt
排错记录/_*/
排错记录/backup*/

# Local editor/OS noise.
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Note:
# Completed translation sources inside ignored mod trees are intentionally
# force-added. For future batches, use:
